1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,610
M: Ms. Sanchez, I heard that the boss hired someone for the open position.

2
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:05,770
Do you know who this person is?

3
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:14,250
W: Yes, I just got the word from Mr. Miller, and he said that the general manager's position was going to go to Mr. Lee because of his experience.

4
00:00:14,725 --> 00:00:20,330
According to him, it was a tough call because both Mr. Lee and Mr. Harris have excellent qualifications.

5
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,630
M: They are both excellent candidates.

6
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:26,450
But I am a bit surprised that Ms. Simpson was not included in the race.

7
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,590
I was sure that she would be considered.

8
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:38,000
W: She was in the running, but I heard she pulled out of the race because getting a promotion means working longer hours, and she just was not interested in doing that.
